msgid "Rover SITL/MAVProxy Tutorial"
msgstr "Rover SITL/MAVProxy 教程"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:7
#: 2693a3b9bbc64b8b99999c4dab7678ac
msgid ""
"This tutorial provides a basic walk-through of how to use :ref:`SITL <sitl-"
"simulator-software-in-the-loop>` and :ref:`MAVProxy<mavproxy:home>` for "
"*Rover* testing."
msgstr ""
"本教程提供了使用 :ref:`SITL <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` 和 "
":ref:`MAVProxy<mavproxy:home>` 进行 *Rover* 测试的基本演练。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:12
#: e75b561e987044f7802ac1bd341d3db3
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:14
#: 8c06872001874ca298a13b240de785ce
msgid ""
"Rover is an easy platform to get started with. Unlike Copter or Plane there "
"are no fast-moving propellers, so there is no need to arm motors. As "
"movement is along the ground, there is no need to consider taking off or "
"landing, and pausing/loitering/waiting is just \"stopping\". At the end of "
"initialization the Rover is ready to go!"
msgstr ""
"Rover 是一个入门容易的平台。与 Copter 或 Plane 不同，Rover "
"没有高速旋转的螺旋桨，因此无需解锁电机。由于运动在地面进行，无需考虑起飞或降落，暂停/盘旋/等待就是「停车」。初始化完成后，Rover 即可出发！"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:20
#: f96c9c621e0240ddae4d8128d7793891
msgid ""
"The article is intended primarily for developers who want to test new Rover "
"builds and bug fixes using SITL and *MAVProxy*. It shows how to use the "
"different modes, run missions, set a geofence, and perform a number of other"
" basic testing tasks."
msgstr ""
"本文主要面向希望使用 SITL 和 *MAVProxy* 测试 Rover 新构建版本及 bug "
"修复的开发者，介绍如何使用不同模式、运行任务、设置地理围栏以及执行其他基本测试任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:25
#: 3f6eb4bd6c434773aa27eea24bcb8d5e
msgid ""
"The tutorial is complementary to the topic :ref:`Using SITL for ArduPilot "
"Testing <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`."
msgstr ""
"本教程是 :ref:`Using SITL for ArduPilot Testing <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing>` 主题的补充内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:29
#: ba740f10458a44e282f7c26cc25de1da
msgid ""
"We use *MAVProxy* here, but you can :ref:`attach another ground station to "
"SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing_connecting_otheradditional_ground_stations>` if you prefer (similar "
"instructions can be used in any GCS)."
msgstr ""
"我们在此使用 *MAVProxy*，但如果您更喜欢，也可以 :ref:`将其他地面站连接到 SITL（软件在环仿真） <using-sitl-for-"
"ardupilot-testing_connecting_otheradditional_ground_stations>` "
"（类似的说明适用于任何地面站）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:31
#: ac8578de32ae4ede815a8fa1ac835590
msgid ""
"This tutorial is for Rover - see :ref:`Copter <copter-sitl-mavproxy-"
"tutorial>` and :ref:`Plane <plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial>` for similar "
"tutorials on the other vehicles."
msgstr ""
"本教程适用于 Rover——其他机型的类似教程请参见 :ref:`Copter <copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial>` 和 "
":ref:`Plane <plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial>`。"

