#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:116
#: 81ad6d3bf60a486382304c2a5790dae2
msgid "Running a mission"
msgstr "运行任务"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:118
#: 4b6814bb314e46d3a84af167ca6e3152
msgid ""
"You can load a mission at any time using the ``wp load`` command. After "
"you've taken off the current mission will start as soon as you change to "
"``AUTO`` mode."
msgstr "可随时使用 ``wp load`` 命令加载任务。起飞后，切换到 ``AUTO`` 模式后当前任务将立即开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:122
#: ada09e35f201479390383732806f81f8
msgid ""
"The example below shows how to load and start one of the test missions, skip"
" to the second waypoint, and *loop* the mission:"
msgstr "以下示例演示如何加载并启动一个测试任务、跳转到第二个航点，以及*循环*执行任务："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:134
#: 64ca22b9351d418ba488ea4651fc6863
msgid ""
"Rover will only run :ref:`commands it supports <rover:common-mavlink-"
"mission-command-messages-mav_cmd_commands_supported_by_rover>` (others are "
"ignored)."
msgstr ""
"Rover 只会执行 :ref:`其支持的命令 <rover:common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-"
"mav_cmd_commands_supported_by_rover>` （其他命令将被忽略）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:137
#: 16cb1c1ebd2a42b9ab6ef4391fb49587
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MAVProxy Waypoints documentation <mavproxy:mavproxy-waypoints>` "
"lists the full set of available commands (or you can get them using auto-"
"completion by typing \"wp\" on the command line)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAVProxy 航点文档 <mavproxy:mavproxy-waypoints>` "
"列出了所有可用命令的完整集合（也可以在命令行输入「wp」通过自动补全获取）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:141
#: 253c8ff603694c1e908e942d1e8b9264
msgid ""
"If you want to create a waypoint mission, this is most easily done on the "
"map:"
msgstr "如果要创建航点任务，最简便的方法是在地图上操作："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:144
#: 223e75ef8906435a95d0364d26a18604
msgid "Right-click on the map and then select **Mission \\| Draw**."
msgstr "在地图上右键单击，然后选择 **任务 \\| 绘制**。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:149
#: 1fe590d427114ead89994f49ef456bc8
msgid ""
"MAVProxy: Draw Mission Menu (This image is for Copter, but the behaviour is "
"the same)."
msgstr "MAVProxy：绘制任务菜单（此图示为 Copter，但操作相同）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:151
#: 4c30281cc735443b96fa45ea505a395e
msgid "Left-click on the map where you want the points to appear."
msgstr "在地图上左键单击您希望航点出现的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:155
#: 2843b005327d4a838b344fe6b059803e
msgid ""
"Nothing visible will happen when you make the first click. After the second "
"click, lines will join your points to show the path"
msgstr "第一次单击时不会有明显变化。第二次单击后，各点之间将出现连线以显示路径"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:158
#: 5fe7462105ad48e5ac754e796949e39d
msgid ""
"When you're done, you can loop the mission by right-clicking on the map and "
"selecting **Mission \\| Loop**."
msgstr "完成后，可在地图上右键单击并选择 **任务 \\| 循环** 来设置任务循环执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:161
#: 204076b5121b47bda65d50ef208bc2cf
msgid ""
"This approach only allows you to create :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT "
"<rover:mav_cmd_nav_waypoint>` commands. You can edit missions and use other "
"commands on Linux using the *misseditor* module (``module load "
"misseditor``). This is currently broken on Windows. It is also possible to "
"load other types of commands from files."
msgstr ""
"此方法仅允许创建 :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT <rover:mav_cmd_nav_waypoint>` 命令。在 Linux"
" 上可以使用 *misseditor* 模块（``module load misseditor``）编辑任务和使用其他命令。该模块目前在 Windows"
" 上无法使用。也可以从文件中加载其他类型的命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:170
#: 32f013c3ab2044cdb2ed32a6d8794ea6
msgid ""
"At any point you can pause the mission by setting the mode to ``HOLD``, and "
"restart by setting it back to ``AUTO``."
msgstr "您可以随时通过将模式设为 ``HOLD`` 来暂停任务，然后切换回 ``AUTO`` 重新启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:174
#: 13e58cea9c1a4780b8fce9b4c256b37c
msgid "Changing mode"
msgstr "切换模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:176
#: 996a1237bb454e5c8d1c31fbb69c8d4b
msgid ""
"Rover supports a small number of modes which you can list in *MAVProxy* with"
" the ``mode`` command:"
msgstr "Rover 支持少量模式，可在 *MAVProxy* 中使用 ``mode`` 命令列出："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:184
#: aa6e036317234dcc8b9a5bacec42e43f
msgid "The useful modes for simulation are:"
msgstr "仿真中常用的模式有："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:186
#: 611afb3f46874bc2b02be83076494d6f
msgid "``AUTO`` - Run a mission"
msgstr "``AUTO`` - 执行任务"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:187
#: 7eae227eccde457caa8aa7170c671250
msgid "``GUIDED`` - Move where directed by GCS"
msgstr "``GUIDED`` - 按地面站指令移动"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:188
#: 787e119c8bbe4d8c94773951f5b68bfc
msgid "``RTL`` - Return to launch"
msgstr "``RTL`` - 返回起飞点"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:189
#: bca7617ca6ae4d95a2eba1c127635346
msgid "``HOLD`` - WAIT - pause mission/stop moving."
msgstr "``HOLD`` - 等待——暂停任务/停止移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:191
#: 3d5dc26aa4484be0b722891e21144a39
msgid ""
"As shown in the previous section, you can change the mode by specifying "
"``mode modename``. Most of the modes can be set by just entering the mode "
"name, e.g. ``rtl``, ``auto``, ``hold``."
msgstr ""
"如上一节所示，可以通过 ``mode modename`` 切换模式。大多数模式可以直接输入模式名设置，例如 "
"``rtl``、``auto``、``hold``。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:196
#: ab7c7d5178a64fb2a0280d4f20f595fd
msgid "Testing the vehicle"
msgstr "测试飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:198
#: fec530205ae0486bb6b97abd66642d75
msgid ""
"*MAVProxy* allows you to list all the parameters affecting the vehicle and "
"simulation using ``param show *``, and to set any parameter using: ``param "
"set PARAM_NAME VALUE``. In addition to affecting the vehicle itself some "
"parameters simulate the performance/failure of specific hardware components "
"and the environment (for example, the wind). These can be listed using: "
"`:ref:`param show sim*``. The topic `Using SITL for ArduPilot Testing "
"<using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>` explains more about how you can test "
"using SITL."
msgstr ""
"*MAVProxy* 允许使用 ``param show *`` 列出影响飞行器和仿真的所有参数，并使用 ``param set PARAM_NAME "
"VALUE`` 设置任意参数。除影响飞行器本身外，某些参数可以仿真特定硬件组件的性能/故障及环境（例如风）。可使用 ` :ref:`param show"
" sim*` ` 列出这些参数。主题「使用 SITL 进行 ArduPilot 测试 <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing>」详细介绍了如何使用 SITL 进行测试。"
